---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
import { 
  House, 
  Users, 
  HandsClapping, 
  ArrowRight, 
  Heartbeat, 
  ShieldCheck, 
  BellRinging 
} from "phosphor-svelte";

const { user } = Astro.locals;

if (user) {
  switch (user.role) {
    case "admin":
    case "cadre":
      return Astro.redirect("/dashboard");
    case "volunteer":
      return Astro.redirect("/volunteer/dashboard");
    case "family":
      return Astro.redirect("/family/dashboard");
    default:
      return Astro.redirect("/dashboard");
  }
}
---

<Layout
  title="Kabarin - Kepedulian Komunitas untuk Lansia Sejahtera"
  description="Platform pemantauan dan kepedulian terintegrasi bagi kader RT, keluarga, dan relawan lansia."
>
  <header class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between">
    <span class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-dark">Kabarin.</span>
  </header>

  <main class="flex flex-col gap-24 py-12 px-6">
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand bg-brand/10 rounded-full">
        <Heartbeat weight="bold" class="size-4" /> Platform Komunitas Lansia
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-dark leading-tight">
        Menjaga Lansia Bersama, Dari Tingkat RT Hingga Keluarga.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-dark/60 max-w-2xl">
        Kabarin menghubungkan pengurus RT, anggota keluarga, dan relawan lokal dalam satu sistem tanggap untuk memastikan setiap lansia terpantau aman, sehat, dan tidak terabaikan.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a 
          href="#pilih-peran" 
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-brand text-white font-semibold hover:bg-brand/90 transition"
        >
          Pilih Peran Anda
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/login" 
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-light-darker text-dark font-medium hover:bg-light-darker/80 transition"
        >
          Masuk ke Akun
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-light-darker/40 border border-dark/5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="size-11 rounded-2xl bg-brand/10 text-brand flex items-center justify-center">
          <ShieldCheck weight="duotone" class="size-6" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Pendataan Terpusat RT</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 leading-relaxed">
          Kader RT dapat memvalidasi data domisili, kondisi kesehatan awal, dan penanggung jawab lansia di lingkungannya.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-light-darker/40 border border-dark/5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="size-11 rounded-2xl bg-accent/15 text-accent flex items-center justify-center">
          <BellRinging weight="duotone" class="size-6" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Laporan Rutin & Darurat</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 leading-relaxed">
          Keluarga menerima kabar langsung jika ada jadwal posyandu, kunjungan kesehatan, atau kondisi darurat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-light-darker/40 border border-dark/5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="size-11 rounded-2xl bg-dark/10 text-dark/70 flex items-center justify-center">
          <HandsClapping weight="duotone" class="size-6" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Aksi Gotong Royong</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 leading-relaxed">
          Membagi beban kunjungan fisik kepada relawan terverifikasi agar perhatian terdistribusi merata.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pilih-peran" class="max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-8 scroll-mt-12">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-dark">Siapa Anda?</h2>
        <p class="text-dark/50 text-base mt-2">
          Pilih akses portal yang paling relevan dengan peran Anda di lingkungan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="group flex items-center gap-5 rounded-[28px] bg-brand/10 px-7 py-6 hover:bg-brand/15 transition-all duration-200 border border-brand/10 hover:border-brand/25"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand/20">
            <House weight="fill" class="size-7 text-brand" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-dark">Kader / Ketua RT</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 mt-0.5">
              Daftarkan wilayah RT Anda dan mulai memantau lansia binaan.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ArrowRight weight="bold" class="size-5 text-brand shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
        </a>

        <a
          href="/register/family"
          class="group flex items-center gap-5 rounded-[28px] bg-accent/10 px-7 py-6 hover:bg-accent/15 transition-all duration-200 border border-accent/10 hover:border-accent/25"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent/20">
            <Users weight="fill" class="size-7 text-accent" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-dark">Keluarga</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 mt-0.5">
              Daftarkan orang tua atau kerabat lansia Anda ke sistem RT.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ArrowRight weight="bold" class="size-5 text-accent shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
        </a>

        <a
          href="/login"
          class="group flex items-center gap-5 rounded-[28px] bg-light-darker px-7 py-6 hover:bg-light-darker/70 transition-all duration-200 border border-dark/5"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-dark/10">
            <HandsClapping weight="fill" class="size-7 text-dark/60" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-dark">Relawan</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-dark/60 mt-0.5">
              Sudah didaftarkan oleh Kader RT? Masuk dengan akun Anda.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ArrowRight weight="bold" class="size-5 text-dark/40 shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-sm text-dark/50">
        Sudah punya akun sebelumnya? <a href="/login" class="text-brand font-medium hover:underline">Masuk di sini</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-dark/5 mt-16 py-8 text-center text-xs text-dark/40">
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Kabarin. Sistem Terintegrasi Pemantauan Lansia.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>